---
// Landing page — the Wollack Systems story: who Will Wollack is, why it can't
// wait, and how (hustle, networking, and a cofounder found mid-pitch).
// Canonical slate + electric blue Industrial Editorial theme (see DESIGN.md).
// Product detail lives on /journeyman (the "Rust & Iron" variant page).
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import {
  organization,
  personWillWollack,
  personEthanDavidson,
  webSite,
} from '../lib/schema';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Wollack Systems: capturing manufacturing expertise before it retires"
  description="Wollack Systems writes down what America's best machinists know, hands-free, before it retires with them. Meet the founder and book a walkthrough."
  path="/"
  jsonLd={[organization(), personWillWollack(), personEthanDavidson(), webSite()]}
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container hero-grid">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Knowledge capture for American manufacturing</p>
        <h1>American manufacturing is about to forget how it works. We're here to write it down.</h1>
        <p class="lede">
          Somewhere right now, a plant is calling back an operator who retired six years ago. Ear
          to the housing, one tap with a small hammer.
          {" "}<strong>The machine runs.</strong>
        </p>
        <p class="lede-strong">
          That invoice is why Wollack Systems exists. We write down what your best people know,
          before it retires with them.
        </p>
        <div class="cta-row">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="mailto:willwollack@gmail.com?subject=Walkthrough%20request"
            >Book a walkthrough</a
          >
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/about/">Meet the founder</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="invoice-card" aria-label="The famous itemized invoice">
        <div class="invoice-head">INVOICE</div>
        <table>
          <caption class="sr-only">Itemized repair invoice</caption>
          <tr><td>Repair to machine</td><td class="num">$10,000</td></tr>
          <tr class="invoice-divider"><td colspan="2">Itemized, as requested:</td></tr>
          <tr><td>One hammer</td><td class="num">$5</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Knowing where to tap</td><td class="num">$9,995</td></tr>
          <tr class="invoice-total"><td>TOTAL</td><td class="num">$10,000</td></tr>
        </table>
        <p class="invoice-note">$9,995 was knowledge. Nobody wrote it down. We do.</p>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- The founder -->
  <section class="section section-tinted" id="founder">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Who is Will Wollack?</h2>
      <p class="lede">
        The founder of Wollack Systems and the voice of Journeyman. The method is the old one: show
        up, network, hustle. Wherever people who make things gather, the same line comes up:
        {" "}<strong>the knowledge that runs your plant is one retirement from gone.</strong>
      </p>
      <div class="accent-callout">
        <!-- The pitch itself lands once, in step 02 below. /about does not retell it. -->
        <p>Every company starts as a pitch somebody was stubborn enough to keep giving.</p>
      </div>
      <p class="founder-more">
        <a class="inline-link" href="/about/">Read the full founder story &rarr;</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- The mission -->
  <section class="section" id="mission">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Why it can't wait.</h2>
      <div class="grid-3">
        <div class="fact">
          <div class="fact-number">&asymp;1/3</div>
          <p>of US manufacturing workers are over 55. They're leaving together.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="fact">
          <div class="fact-number">800 yrs</div>
          <p>of trades. The method never changed: stand next to someone until you can do it too.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="fact">
          <div class="fact-number">First time</div>
          <p>AI can finally learn from a recording. It can't go get one. That's our job.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="section-close">
        When the best troubleshooter on the floor retires, the line slows down and nobody can say
        why. They're still reachable. Not for long.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How it's being built -->
  <section class="section section-tinted" id="how">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>How: hustle, then the record.</h2>
      <ol class="steps">
        <li>
          <h3>Show up. Pitch. Repeat.</h3>
          <p>
            Selling face to face doesn't scale. Will does it anyway. Trade events, plant
            walkthroughs, one pitch until the right person hears it.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>One pitch found a cofounder.</h3>
          <p>
            In Newport Beach, Will pitched a room full of manufacturers.
            {" "}<a class="inline-link" href="https://etok.me/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Ethan Davidson</a>,
            a software engineer formerly of Google, was one of them. They connected afterward and
            hit it off. Ethan builds the AI that turns shop-floor talk into a written record.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Build something real.</h3>
          <p>
            Journeyman records real experts on real floors. Your plant keeps the recordings; what we
            learn beyond your floor travels de-identified. One expert, one plant at a time.
          </p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- The work -->
  <section class="section" id="work">
    <div class="container pricing-wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">The work</p>
      <p class="price-anchor"><strong>Journeyman</strong></p>
      <p class="price-sub">
        Wollack Systems writes down what your best people know, hands-free. Journeyman is the
        product that does it.
      </p>
      <div class="cta-row cta-center">
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/journeyman/">See how Journeyman works</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Final CTA -->
  <section class="section section-paper" id="book">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>The people who know how to run your plant<br />are retiring right now.</h2>
      <p class="section-close-ink">
        One conversation tells you what capture would look like on your floor.
      </p>
      <div class="cta-row cta-center">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="mailto:willwollack@gmail.com?subject=Walkthrough%20request"
          >Book a walkthrough</a
        >
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://etok.me/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
          >Meet the cofounder</a
        >
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  /* Page-scoped: inline text links inside step copy on the dark ground. */
  .inline-link {
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-color: var(--color-accent-blue);
    text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }
  .inline-link:hover {
    color: var(--color-accent-blue);
  }
  .founder-more {
    margin-top: 28px;
    text-align: center;
  }
</style>
